    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11280" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cor-rēpo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conr-</span></b> ), psi, 3, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. n., to creep</i> or <i>slink to a place, to creep</i> (rare but class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intra murum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2</span></i>
			, praef. § 3; <i><span class="en">Col. 1</span></i>, praef. § 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">15: in aliquam onerariam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 10, 12, 2</span></i>
			: correpunt membra pavore, <i>creep</i>,
			* <i><span class="en">Lucr. 5, 1218</span></i>.—Fig.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in dumeta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 1, 24, 68</span></i>
			 (v. Schoemann ad h. l.).</div>
